---
// Wortmarke: "Domis" modern, "on tour" handschriftlich, kleiner Pin als i-Punkt-Ersatz
---
<span class="logo" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="pin" viewBox="0 0 24 32" width="16" height="22"><path d="M12 1C6 1 1.5 5.4 1.5 11.2 1.5 19 12 31 12 31s10.5-12 10.5-19.8C22.5 5.4 18 1 12 1z" fill="var(--sea)"/><circle cx="12" cy="11" r="4" fill="var(--linen)"/></svg>
  <span class="w">Domis</span><span class="h">on tour</span>
</span>
<style>
  .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; }
  .pin { align-self: center; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .w { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
  .h { font-family: var(--hand); font-size: 1.65rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--sea); transform: rotate(-4deg) translateY(2px); display: inline-block; }
</style>
